Meta.documentation:Resource.NewInput
Meta.documentation:Declares one input port of a NewResource: Resource.NewInput:<Type>:<name>.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:<Type> is the port's type chain (e.g. String, Number, or a subtype
Meta.documentation:chain like image_png). An empty type (Resource.NewInput:inp) is a
Meta.documentation:chainless port that matches every offered chain. <name> is the port
Meta.documentation:name used for ?input/#output selection.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The configuration rides as Dawn INPUTS - never as tail parameters.
Meta.documentation:Two assignment forms: the URI parameter assign (the leading |
Meta.documentation:marks an assigned input)
Meta.documentation:Resource.NewInput:String:name?|all=true&|explicit=true&|group=g,
Meta.documentation:or a wired value selecting the input by name
Meta.documentation:[Boolean:true]>>NewInput:String:name?all. The runtime resolves
Meta.documentation:each value resource and fires the matching input function:
Meta.documentation:in_Boolean_all_$explicit keeps the input after it is connected,
Meta.documentation:in_Boolean_explicit_$explicit keeps it out of the automatic
Meta.documentation:input list, in_String_group_$explicit / in_Number_group_$explicit
Meta.documentation:store a group (storage only in v1 - see the ROADMAP socket-pin
Meta.documentation:proposal), in_String_name_$explicit renames the port (only
Meta.documentation:before any downstream use read it). The declared name stays
Meta.documentation:clean - the runtime marker mangling (_$all etc.) happens inside
Meta.documentation:the resource.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Canonical use - port definitions are elements of the list that
Meta.documentation:flows into a NewResource declaration:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:  [[ [ [String:Hello]>>String.concatenate:>>NewInput:String:inp1 ] ]]>>NewResource:Tester
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Values the declarer-time chain captures stay captured; once the
Meta.documentation:constructed resource is wired downstream, captures forward through
Meta.documentation:its matching channel and inputs replay through the named port.
Meta.documentation:@port in_default_$all - the catch-all capture input; every offered chain binds here
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_all_$explicit - URI parameter input |all=true: keeps the input multi-bindable after connection
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_explicit_$explicit - URI parameter input |explicit=true: keeps the port out of the automatic input list
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_group_$explicit - URI parameter input |group=<g> (quoted or text): stores a group - storage only in v1
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_group_$explicit - URI parameter input |group=<n> (number): stores a group - storage only in v1
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_name_$explicit - URI parameter input |name=<n>: renames the port (only before a downstream use read it)
Meta.documentation:@see Resource.NewResource
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20NewInput%3A%3CType%3E%3A%3Cname%3E%5B%3F%7Call%3Dtrue%5D%5B%26%7Cexplicit%3Dtrue%5D%5B%26%7Cgroup%3D%3Cg%3E%5D%5B%26%7Cname%3D%3Cn%3E%5D%0A%2F%2F%20declares%20one%20input%20port%20of%20a%20NewResource.%20The%20URI%20tail%20carries%20the%0A%2F%2F%20port's%20type%20chain%20and%20name%20ONLY%20-%20in_instanciate%20parses%20nothing%20else.%0A%2F%2F%20The%20flags%20ride%20as%20Dawn%20INPUTS%3A%20%3F%7Call%3Dtrue%20(the%20leading%20%7C%20marks%20an%0A%2F%2F%20assigned%20input%20-%20the%20runtime%20resolves%20the%20value%20resource%20and%20calls%20the%0A%2F%2F%20input%20function%20when%20the%20declaring%20flow%20ends)%20or%20a%20wired%20value%20selecting%0A%2F%2F%20the%20input%20by%20name%20(%5BBoolean%3Atrue%5D%3E%3ENewInput%3AString%3Aname%3Fall).%20The%20input%0A%2F%2F%20functions%20are%20in_Boolean_all_%24explicit%2C%20in_Boolean_explicit_%24explicit%2C%0A%2F%2F%20in_String_group_%24explicit%20%2F%20in_Number_group_%24explicit%2C%0A%2F%2F%20in_String_name_%24explicit%20-%20the%20_%24explicit%20suffix%20keeps%20them%20out%20of%20the%0A%2F%2F%20automatic%20input%20list%20so%20they%20can%20not%20shadow%20the%20capture%20slot.%20The%0A%2F%2F%20runtime%20port%20key%20carries%20the%20_%24-markers%3B%20the%20declared%20name%20stays%20clean.%0A%2F%2F%20Groups%20are%20stored%20only%20in%20v1%20(see%20the%20ROADMAP%20socket-pin%20proposal).%0Afunction%20NewInput()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%20%22NewInput%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20NewInputProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20NewInputProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2C%20resource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.newResource%20%3D%20null%3B%20%2F%2F%20the%20constructed%20NewResource%20processor%2C%20set%20at%20connect%0A%09let%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20re-apply%20the%20registration%3A%20a%20flag%20or%20name%20input%20arriving%20after%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20port%20connected%20rewrites%20the%20registered%20port%20key%0A%09this.refresh%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(self.newResource%20%26%26%20self.newResource.refreshPortRegistration)%0A%09%09%09self.newResource.refreshPortRegistration(self)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20catch-all%20capture%20input%3A%20every%20offered%20chain%20binds%20here%3B%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20captured%20value%20forwards%20through%20the%20currently%20wired%20instance%20of%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20constructed%20resource%20(the%20typed%20out%20channel%20first%2C%20else%20any%20bound%0A%09%2F%2F%20non-lifecycle%20out%20channel)%0A%09this.in_default_%24all%20%3D%20async%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09resource.captured%20%3D%20input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource%20%3F%20input%20%3A%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input)%3B%0A%09%09let%20ref%20%3D%20self.seedRef%3B%0A%09%09if%20(ref%20%26%26%20ref.proc)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20proc%20%3D%20ref.proc%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20fn%20%3D%20(ref.key%20%26%26%20typeof%20proc%5Bref.key%5D%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22function%22)%20%3F%20proc%5Bref.key%5D%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(!fn)%0A%09%09%09%09for%20(let%20k%20of%20Object.keys(proc))%0A%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(k.indexOf(%22out_%22)%20!%3D%3D%200%20%7C%7C%20typeof%20proc%5Bk%5D%20!%3D%3D%20%22function%22)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(k%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22out_begin%22%20%7C%7C%20k%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22out_end%22%20%7C%7C%20k%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22out_error%22%20%7C%7C%20k%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22out_go%22)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(k.indexOf(%22_default%22)%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%20%7B%20fn%20%3D%20proc%5Bk%5D%3B%20break%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(k.indexOf(%22_%24%22)%20%3D%3D%3D%20-1%20%26%26%20!fn)%20fn%20%3D%20proc%5Bk%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(fn)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09let%20r%20%3D%20fn(input)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(r)%20%7B%20if%20(r.promise)%20await%20r.promise()%3B%20else%20await%20r%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20tail%20is%20only%20%3Ctype%20chain%3E%3A%3Cname%3E%3B%20the%20runtime%20splits%20the%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20%3Fparameters%20itself%20and%20delivers%20them%20to%20the%20input%20functions%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20below%20-%20no%20flag%20parsing%20here%0A%09%09let%20tail%20%3D%20String((input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20tail%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(tail)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%7D%0A%09%09tail%20%3D%20tail.split(%22%3F%22)%5B0%5D.split(%22%23%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09let%20chain%20%3D%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09let%20colon%20%3D%20tail.indexOf(%22%3A%22)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(colon%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09chain%20%3D%20tail.slice(0%2C%20colon)%3B%0A%09%09%09tail%20%3D%20tail.slice(colon%20%2B%201)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.portName%20%3D%20tail%3B%0A%09%09newObject.portType%20%3D%20chain%3B%0A%09%09newObject.portDir%20%20%3D%20%22in%22%3B%0A%09%09newObject.all%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%09newObject.explicit%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%09newObject.group%20%20%20%20%3D%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09newObject.name%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20tail%3B%0A%09%09let%20proc%20%3D%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%09if%20(chain)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20typed%20capture%20slot%3A%20the%20declarer-time%20chain%20binds%20here%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20(the%20port-name%20grammar%20names%20typed%20default%20ports%20in_%3CType%3E_default)%0A%09%09%09let%20chain0%20%3D%20String(chain).split(%22_%22).filter(v%20%3D%3E%20v%20!%3D%3D%20%22%22)%5B0%5D%20%7C%7C%20%22Data%22%3B%0A%09%09%09proc%5B%22in_%22%20%2B%20chain0%20%2B%20%22_default_%24all%22%5D%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09return%20proc.in_default_%24all(input)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20proc%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20port%20configuration%20as%20Dawn%20inputs%20-%20assignable%20in%20syntax%20through%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20URI%20parameters%20(%3F%7Call%3Dtrue%26%7Cexplicit%3Dtrue%26%7Cgroup%3Dg%26%7Cname%3Dn)%3A%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20%3F%7C...%20values%20resolve%20to%20Boolean%2FString%2FNumber%20resources%20and%20arrive%0A%09%2F%2F%20here%20when%20the%20declaring%20flow%20ends.%20They%20carry%20_%24explicit%20so%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20runtime's%20auto%20input%20list%20can%20not%20match%20them%20against%20the%20capture%0A%09%2F%2F%20slot's%20chain%20(a%20String%20port's%20in_String_group%20would%20otherwise%20win%0A%09%2F%2F%20over%20in_String_default_%24all)%0A%09this.in_Boolean_all_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09resource.all%20%3D%20!!(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%3B%0A%09%09self.refresh()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_explicit_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09resource.explicit%20%3D%20!!(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%3B%0A%09%09self.refresh()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_String_group_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09resource.group%20%3D%20String((input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09self.refresh()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_group_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09resource.group%20%3D%20String(input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09self.refresh()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_String_name_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20value%20%3D%20String((input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(value)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09resource.name%20%3D%20value%3B%0A%09%09%09resource.portName%20%3D%20value%3B%0A%09%09%09self.refresh()%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20when%20a%20port%20connects%20to%20the%20constructed%20NewResource%20it%20registers%20there%0A%09this.previousConnect%20%3D%20this.connect%3B%0A%09this.connect%20%3D%20function(to)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(to%20%26%26%20to.get_resource)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20tr%20%3D%20to.get_resource()%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(tr%20%26%26%20tr.newResourceName%20%26%26%20to.registerInputPort)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09self.newResource%20%3D%20to%3B%0A%09%09%09%09to.registerInputPort(self)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20self.previousConnect(to)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0ANewInput.Processor%20%3D%20NewInputProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20NewInput%3B%0A]>>NewResource:Resource.NewInput
